package "**第二阶段: Single Stream Blocks × 38**\n//transformer.py:857-977//\nFluxSingleTransformerBlock" as PKG_SINGLE #E8F5E9 {

    rectangle "**统一序列输入**\n\nhidden_states: [B, **4608**, 3072]\n前512个token = 文本\n后4096个token = 图像\n\n**但Block不知道也不关心这个区分**\n统一处理所有 token" as SINGLE_INPUT #C8E6C9

    rectangle "**Step 1: AdaLayerNormSingle**\n//transformer.py:257//\n\nnorm_states, gate = norm(hidden_states, emb=temb)\n\n**只有1个norm, 不分图像/文本**\n**只有1个gate, 不分图像/文本**\n比 Double Stream 简洁得多" as SINGLE_NORM #A5D6A7

    rectangle "**Step 2: 并行 Attention + MLP ★ Flux1 vs Flux2 差异**\n\n**Flux 1:** //transformer.py:258-272//\n  MLP 分支: mlp_out = GELU(proj_mlp(norm))\n  Attn 分支: attn_out = attn(norm, encoder=**None**)\n  output = **cat([attn_out, mlp_out]**, dim=-1)\n  → proj_out 压缩回工作维度\n  **MLP和Attention在外部并行, 结果拼接**\n\n**Flux 2:** //flux2/transformer.py:476-486//\n  Flux2**ParallelSelf**Attention 内部:\n  QKV投影和MLP投影**融合在同一个线性层**!\n  一次矩阵乘法同时出 Q,K,V + MLP_hidden\n  **并行不是在外部cat, 而是在投影层就融合了**\n  → 更少的内存访问, 更高的GPU利用率\n\n两者都是 encoder_hidden_states=None\n→ 纯 Self-Attention, 4608/1536 tokens互看" as SINGLE_ATTN #81C784

